[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369109590","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106832#issuecomment-3369109590","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106832","id":3369109590,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7I0IhW","user":{"login":"qezz","id":5172876,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzI4NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5172876?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz","html_url":"https://github.com/qezz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T14:50:48Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T14:55:07Z","body":"I was experimenting with this patch and was getting inconsistent results.\r\n\r\nWith `display/display_server/driver.linuxbsd` set to `wayland`, about 1 game start in 30 ends up as a \"working\" run, when the mouse capture does actually work. All other runs emit errors on\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n# probably from https://github.com/Jeh3no/Godot-State-Machine-Third-Person-Controller\r\n# lines 32 - 36\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\t#capture mouse cursor, and enable camera\r\n\tInput.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED\r\n\tInput.set_use_accumulated_input(false)\r\n\tset_active(active)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nWARNING: radv is not a conformant Vulkan implementation, testing use only.\r\nVulkan 1.4.318 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: AMD - AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (RADV GFX1201)\r\n\r\nERROR: Condition \"!windows.has(p_window_id)\" is true. Returning: nullptr\r\n   at: window_get_wl_surface (platform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_thread.cpp:3697)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://addons/PlayerCharacter/OrbitControl/orbit_view.gd:34)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"locked_surface\" is null.\r\n   at: seat_state_lock_pointer (platform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_thread.cpp:3316)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://addons/PlayerCharacter/OrbitControl/orbit_view.gd:34)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"pointed_win\" is null.\r\n   at: _mouse_update_mode (platform/linuxbsd/wayland/display_server_wayland.cpp:404)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://addons/PlayerCharacter/OrbitControl/orbit_view.gd:34)\r\n```\r\n\r\nthen, if i add `await get_tree().create_timer(1).timeout ` before it\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\t#capture mouse cursor, and enable camera\r\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1).timeout \r\n\tInput.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED\r\n\tInput.set_use_accumulated_input(false)\r\n\tset_active(active)\r\n```\r\n\r\nthen it works every time (obviously, after a 1 second of delay).\r\n\r\nSo I assume there's a race condition happens that causes the mouse to not be captured properly\r\n\r\nUPD:\r\n\r\nthe version it was tested against:\r\n\r\nnixos unstable channel, `v4.5.stable.nixpkgs [876b29033]` with this patch applied as\r\n\r\n```nix\r\n  godot_patched = pkgs.unstable.godot.overrideAttrs (old: {\r\n    patches = old.patches ++ [\r\n      (pkgs.fetchpatch {\r\n        url = \"https://patch-diff.githubusercontent.com/raw/godotengine/godot/pull/106832.patch\";\r\n        hash = \"sha256-/wOcOorPMZ9kh0W1gLYfqJR07aZObnOK0TKaLZUlDUU=\";\r\n      })\r\n    ];\r\n  });\r\n\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369109590/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369116103","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106832#issuecomment-3369116103","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106832","id":3369116103,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7I0KHH","user":{"login":"qezz","id":5172876,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzI4NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5172876?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz","html_url":"https://github.com/qezz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T15:02:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T15:02:57Z","body":"Also noticed that the timeout doesn't help if the mouse cursor is focusing some other window (e.g. the editor window) when the mouse capture is set","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369116103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392875798","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106832#issue